{"updated":"2026-10-31T23:50:26.407Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DfKZ-srE6Sc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfKZ-srE6Sc","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"打造一隻自己的 AI VTuber 或虛擬桌寵，終於不用再搞到心態炸裂了。\n\n最近逛到一個專為「虛擬 AI 伴侶」打造的開源神級框架：Airi (by moeru-ai)。\n\n以前想做這種專案有多崩潰？你得自己手搓語音辨識（ASR）聽懂人話、串大模型（LLM）思考，再接語音合成（TTS）發聲，最後還要寫一堆程式碼去同步 Live2D / VRM 皮套的嘴型跟情緒動作，開了四五個 Terminal 還常常卡成木偶。\n\nAiri 直接把「聽、想、說、動」打包成完整的閉環管線。只要寫好設定檔給她人設、口癖與專屬記憶，就能一鍵喚醒一個低延遲、會隨對話情緒自動變換表情與動作的二次元數位伴侶。\n\n比起以前東拼西湊拼裝車還延遲三秒，這套優雅又絲滑太多了","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:47:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T02:56:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKZ_WbE9Yn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfKZ_WbE9Yn","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"github.com/moeru…","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:47:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T02:56:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKYqPOAFqe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfKYqPOAFqe","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"AI Agent 已經進化到自己蓋辦公室了？😂\n\n最近看到一個超酷的案例：X 上的 dallastesla 召集自己的 Grok Bots 開會，問它們想在什麼樣的環境工作。\n\n結果幾個小時後，這群 AI 竟然自己打造出一間虛擬辦公室！\n\n而且不只是像素裝飾，它能即時反映 Agent 的運作狀態：\n\n🏢 收到任務 → AI 走到自己的辦公桌敲鍵盤\n\n🤝 跨模型協作 → 走到同事桌前，或去沙發休息區討論\n\n📋 需要主管審核 → 走進幕僚長 Alfred 的辦公室交接\n\n其實這些走路動畫對執行任務完全沒必要，但比起整天盯著死板乾癟的 Terminal Log，把抽象流程變成「看自己的 AI 員工上班」，體驗直接完全不同。\n\n未來管理 AI Agent，搞不好真的就像在玩《模擬市民》或經營養成遊戲。\n\n只是沒想到，連 AI 最後都逃不過回辦公室上班的命運 🤣\n\n原始影片與推文放留言👇","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:37:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T02:56:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKY2TDk9ah","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfKY2TDk9ah","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"x.com/dalla…","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:37:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T02:56:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfHJbauE6Q7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfHJbauE6Q7","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"如果說 shadcn/ui 給了你乾淨好維護的骨架，那 Magic UI 就是直接幫你的 Landing Page 注入靈魂。裡面整包全都是寫好 Framer Motion + Tailwind CSS 的現成動效組件——像跑動的光束（Animated Beam）、Bento Grid、Dock 欄、霓虹邊框，全都可以直接複製貼上或用 CLI 抓進專案。\n\n特別是配合 Cursor / Claude Code 搓官網時，直接叫 AI 抓組件組裝，5 分鐘就能搞定頂級質感的 SaaS 首頁。\n\n比每次在那邊手調 CSS keyframes 幾像素、還被嫌頁面很死板快了大概 100 倍","timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:24:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":4,"reposts":2,"shares":0},"score":18,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfHJcQEE5Do","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfHJcQEE5Do","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"github.com/magic…\nmalilion.github.io/githu…","timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:25:06.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfHJc52kzGG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfHJc52kzGG","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"歡迎加入\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:25:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFVXA5gNzG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfFVXA5gNzG","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"它把高中物理、化學、生物、地理的知識，直接做成可以操作的 3D 互動實驗。\n\n目前已經有 54 個實驗，包含光電效應、電解反應、細胞分裂、洋流與大氣環流等。\n\n最酷的是，每個實驗都是一個約 1 MB 的獨立 HTML 檔案，不需要安裝軟體，下載後直接用瀏覽器開啟，離線也能操作。\n\n而且不是單純播放動畫，還能調整實驗參數，觀察 3D 模型變化，搭配步驟引導理解原理。\n\n所以拿來做互動式教學感覺超級適合\n甚至可以把抽象的技術文件變成能親手操作的互動教材。\n\n感覺以後學習複雜知識，不一定只能看影片，直接進去實驗可能更有趣 😂","timestamp":"2026-10-29T15:32:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":2,"shares":1},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFVksOk7LL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfFVksOk7LL","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GitHub：\ngithub.com/smith…\n線上體驗：\nlab.tongjiang.app","timestamp":"2026-10-29T15:32:38.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFGhz7E5kW","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfFGhz7E5kW","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"📌 Flipbook\nmalilion.github.io/flipb…\n歡迎加入「碼力獅冒險公會」\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:21:10.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfFGYhrAC28","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfFGYhrAC28","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"我把電子書做成真的可以「翻」的書了 📖\n\n現在閱讀 PDF、EPUB，大多都是上下滑動。\n但我想要的是那種坐在書桌前，一頁一頁翻書的感覺。\n\n所以做了一個 Flipbook，還直接做了 2D 和 3D 兩個版本。\n\n📖 2D：可以拖曳頁角翻頁、切換紙張風格，還有翻頁聲。\n🕯️ 3D：用 Three.js 做出立體書房，紙張翻動時會自然彎曲，甚至能切換暖光、日光和燭光。\n\n另外還支援：\n✅ TXT / Markdown / EPUB / PDF 匯入\n✅ 紅絲帶書籤、螢光筆標記\n✅ 自動分頁、章節目錄、閱讀進度記錄\n✅ 本機解析，不需要把書籍上傳伺服器\n\n最有趣的是，3D 版的翻頁不是單純旋轉一張平面，而是讓紙張產生 S 形彎曲\n你喜歡方便的電子書，還是有翻頁儀式感的紙本書？\n\n#ThreeJS #WebDevelopment#閱讀#book#書","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:21:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DfKUnwKES3G","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfKUnwKES3G","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"以下卡通是大家的童年嗎！？😆\n一位卡友分享卡通頻道裡的一些卡通：\n探險活寶 麻辣嬌娃 校園嬌娃 德克斯特\n小孩大聯盟 大鼻與酷蒂 阿甘妙世界\n杰克龍 變身國王 飛哥與小佛\n愛吃鬼巧達 豆豆先生\n米奇妙妙屋 史迪奇\n你還有看過哪些卡通呢！🙌","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:00:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":19,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":29,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T02:56:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKUppOke-d","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfKUppOke-d","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"你最喜歡的一部卡通是？👀\n原文來自✨#閒聊 我的童年是卡通頻道跟迪士尼啦🥺✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多動漫的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:00:46.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T02:56:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKNwFYD12i","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfKNwFYD12i","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"一位卡友好奇分享了一個問題：現在單身的人真的這麼多嗎？\n現在看到很多文章或影片，在說「不婚不生，快樂一生」\n也看到一些YT影片，說現在適婚年齡的人有約60%單身\n原本沒什麼感覺，但今年我跟交往多年的男友分手了\n時間空出來，跑去跟好久不見的朋友、同學們聚會\n上次跟同學聚會（我們30-31歲），整桌女生全部單身！\n有的人是婚事談不妥分手，有的是遇到劈腿渣男\n有的是工作生活圈遇不到適合的… \n才發現單身比例好像真的很高\n好奇想問問看\n適婚年齡的各位，現在單身比例真的這麼高嗎？","timestamp":"2026-10-31T13:00:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":16,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":2},"score":21,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKNxkpjwZ2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfKNxkpjwZ2","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"好奇大家身邊的人是單身居多還是有伴侶的居多呢？😲\n原文來自✨好奇，現在單身的人真的這麼多嗎？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-31T13:00:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T02:56:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKG6IyDH7H","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfKG6IyDH7H","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家決定離職的契機是什麼呢？\n一位卡友分享：公司一直要求大家做出成效\n但實際要執行專案時，預算卻遲遲申請不下來\n企劃、執行方式跟預期成果都整理好了\n送上去卻一直沒有下文\n結果到了工作報告\n又被問為什麼沒有進展\n加上公司管理比較傳統，很多事情都要經過好幾層主管確認\n想問問大家，如果薪水跟工時都還可以\n但公司制度跟做事方式讓人越來越不認同\n會選擇繼續待著，還是開始認真找下一份工作？🧐","timestamp":"2026-10-31T12:00:41.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKG6-PDBVZ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfKG6-PDBVZ","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"需要大家的指點🥸\n原文來自✨#閒聊 一份工作到底爛到什麼程度，才值得離職？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多工作的討論～","timestamp":"2026-10-31T12:00:48.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"r