stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"DfFE0oKjpYj","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfFE0oKjpYj","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"經過一週多的 beta tester 回饋＋優化後 EasyType 進入一到一個我更喜歡的狀態～！！\n\n免費公測中(目前只支援Mac Silicon chips)🔥🔥\n字數無上限～\n\n👇 如果你也想趁機大大提升生產力 歡迎來幫我試用看看唷 🙏","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:08:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFFIjbjdy4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfFFIjbjdy4","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"👉 easytype.dev","timestamp":"2026-10-29T13:08:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE20HcjbYH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE20HcjbYH","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"這週面試了一個 Senior QA 的職缺。\n\n面試前我特別把懶人報 Lauren Tan 跟 Matt Pocock 怎麼 Code Review, 怎麼一個月 Ship 2000+ PR 的影片「二刷」\n\n真的好險有特別複習，面試中關於 AI 驗證與自動化流程，怎麼信任ＡＩ等等的問題，這兩支影片的觀念基本上就幫我回答了 8 成。剩下的 2 成，就看你有沒有真的動手應用到自己的專案。\n\n幫大家重點整理好了👇","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:03:51.000Z","stats":{"likes":114,"replies":4,"reposts":12,"shares":63},"score":158,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE20eKjSSr","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE20eKjSSr","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"1. 核心瓶頸是「Trust」：開發速度已經不是問題，難的是你有多信任 Agent?你夠信任他，才敢放手讓他自主做事，也才能降低人介入的比率。\n\n2. 定義邊界與風險：Agent 自己 review 完沒問題，不代表真的沒問題。 要確實定義 one-way-door / two-way-door, 以及爆掉時的 Blast Radius。\n\n3. 眼見為憑 ＆ Context：不能相信 AI 說測試完成了，強制要求附上截圖或是recording，同時在 Review 時加入歷史 ticket + 相關的 bug context。\n\n4. 被拒的 PR 超級珍貴：要記錄下 Agent 開的 PR 被工程師 Reject 時留下的「Why」，是讓系統進化的關鍵。透過 Feedback Loop，繼續回饋優化Harness Quality!","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:03:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":18,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":10},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE205VjZT3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE205VjZT3","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"附上兩隻超有料精華影片：\nyoutube.com/watch…","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:03:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":9,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":4},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfE21ZajXFc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfE21ZajXFc","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"youtube.com/watch…","timestamp":"2026-10-29T11:04:01.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":2},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DfHvQpIAcNH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfHvQpIAcNH","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Firstrade 不要以為你用貓咪賣萌的 500 error 就可以\n看了一下又不是熔斷\n怎麼 Firstrade 自己先燒掉了\n\n用 app 進不去的人可以嘗試用網頁版，比較有機會進的去","timestamp":"2026-10-30T13:55:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfGuj9CkUsI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfGuj9CkUsI","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"當初做股票的 mods \n不是為了看到這個...","timestamp":"2026-10-30T04:30:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":16,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":22,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFftcBgQTN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfFftcBgQTN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"OpenAI pro 方案\n額度兩倍！\n\n也就是說原本20x縮水成10x的計劃取消","timestamp":"2026-10-29T17:01:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":133,"replies":29,"reposts":5,"shares":28},"score":206,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfEGCmBkTUt","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfEGCmBkTUt","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"眾銀行們\n不考慮做一下 mac studio 的貸款嗎？\n\n這拿來當抵押品應該比汽車還不錯","timestamp":"2026-10-29T03:57:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":360,"replies":62,"reposts":4,"shares":177},"score":496,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DfKzM4tD61s","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfKzM4tD61s","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"收到Claude五小時限制取消的信件了！","timestamp":"2026-10-31T18:27:43.000Z","stats":{"likes":14,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T02:56:26+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfIzboNj3F4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfIzboNj3F4","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"Claude 把 5 小時限制拿掉了，但只有一部分人有。\n​\nAnthropic 官方公告，方案改名：Max 5x 改叫 Max，Max 20x 改叫 Ultra，價格不變，每月 US$100 和 US$200。\n​\nUltra 這次拿掉了 5 小時限制，只限通過驗證的帳號，分批開放。官方的理由是：Claude 越來越多工作會在背景跑好幾個小時，不該做到一半就因為 5 小時限制停下來。\n​\n這篇整理了：\n◼︎ 新舊方案名稱對照\n◼︎ 怎麼檢查自己有沒有通過驗證\n◼︎ 20x 變 10x，到底有沒有被砍\n◼︎ $100 和 $200 現在該怎麼選\n​","timestamp":"2026-10-30T23:51:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-01T01:09:01+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}